      "value": "You got my vote! 😁\n\nFunny story, about 3 years ago I made my first friend in VRChat after commenting on the fact that I thought he had Toe Trackers. Everytime he waked his toes would wiggle on his left or right foot. He said, \"Nah, his foot tracker was messing up.\" I told him it was a feature not an error, and he laughed. 😆\n\nNow you can really have this feature!!! I'm all for it!!! �",
