      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have built a set of toe trackers with SebrinaRena's help. The massive improvement in my immersion was instant once I got them to work as intended. I prefer to be barefoot at home and I play VRC like that as well. Being able to look down on my vr legs and see my toes behave exactly as I expect them to made my VR body feel so much more like it's my own body. So much so that I wouldn't want to play without toe tracking anymore. Avatar walking dynamics are also basically flawless like this, walking really looks perfectly real now as well. I urge the VRChat developers to consider this over any other ideas the concept of toe tracking might create. Please implement this, I'm sure as people grow to learn about this and try it out for themselves, many will start to feel the same as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
